  "details": "Pretty much as the title says,\n\nMany of us really loved the original loading screen and its music as it really brought back memories and nostalgia to all the great moments in the past that go back to 2017 and beyond. The way how the old loading screen and old music was, it gave the game a bit more of an identity and a \"theme song\" to the game.\n\nWith the current loading screen and music, it just feels bland and I really wish we could have the old Loading Screen back. If possible, maybe make an option where people can swap to the old Loading Screen or to the new one; if there are those who also love the new one. Otherwise, I think everyone could agree that the old Loading Screen was amazing and I think it should make a return. <3",
